The 日誌... menu item and the deploy failure notification (有錯誤！請查看日誌) used the mainland word for log files. zh-Hant now says 記錄檔… and 發生錯誤，請查看記錄檔。; zh-Hans is unchanged.
---
 resources/Localizable.xcstrings | 4 ++--
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/resources/Localizable.xcstrings b/resources/Localizable.xcstrings
index c646bdd..b2d5548 100644
--- a/resources/Localizable.xcstrings
+++ b/resources/Localizable.xcstrings
@@ -35,7 +35,7 @@
         "zh-Hant" : {
           "stringUnit" : {
             "state" : "translated",
-            "value" : "有錯誤！請查看日誌"
+            "value" : "發生錯誤，請查看記錄檔。"
           }
         }
       }
@@ -118,7 +118,7 @@
         "zh-Hant" : {
           "stringUnit" : {
             "state" : "translated",
-            "value" : "日誌..."
+            "value" : "記錄檔…"
           }
         }
       }
